| Agent ARCH | 4 | `contracts/`, `src/shared/` |
| Agent TRADING | 7 | `src/trading/` |
| Agent PORTFOLIO | 7 | `src/portfolio/` |
| Agent WEB | 7 | `src/web/` |
| Agent AI | 7 | `src/ai/` |
| Agent QA | 6, 12 | `tests/`, `docs/user_guide/` |
